# Standing, sitting, resting and sleeping in the temple (3001), on the ground and on furniture. Three benches made
# from the park's (3134), one for each word: 1.bench is "at", 2.bench "on" and 3.bench "in", each with room for one;
# 4.bench is the stock one, with no flags. The safe (3131) isn't furniture. Quintus watches, and tries the benches
# when they're taken; Sleeper is under a sleep spell.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
@connect sleeper
Sleeper
psswrd
@return
@obj 3131 3001
@obj 3134 3001
@obj 3134 3001 1 0 2340 0 0
@obj 3134 3001 1 0 1170 0 0
@obj 3134 3001 1 0 585 0 0
@as dec
stand
sit
sit
rest
rest
sit
stand
rest
stand
sleep
sleep
stand
sleep
rest
sleep
sit
stand
sit 1.bench
@as quin
sit 1.bench
rest 1.bench
sleep 1.bench
stand 1.bench
@as dec
rest
sit
stand 1.bench
sleep 1.bench
stand 1.bench
sleep
rest 1.bench
sleep
sit 1.bench
stand
