stand nothing
# Waking: Sleeper can't wake up or be woken; Quintus is woken, but the C stands the waker up instead.
@as sleeper
stand
rest
sit
wake
@as dec
wake sleeper
wake nobody
wake quintus
@as quin
sleep
wake decimus
@as dec
wake quintus
@as quin
wake
@state
